 "Cells" -> {<|"Data" -> ".md\n# TDS: Interactive Signal Processing\n\n> It \
is common in time-domain spectroscopy to observe copies of the initial system \
response due to impedance mismatch. If deconvolution is not possible using \
slab-like models, then we have to smoothly suppress them to avoid artifacts \
in further processing.\n\nWe perform a 'surgery' by applying an envelope \
function to the signal to suppress echoes, which cause oscillations in the \
frequency \
domain:\n\n!![1:W3sidHlwZSI6ImxpbmUiLCJ2ZXJzaW9uIjo0OSwidmVyc2lvbk5vbmNlIjoxN\
